WEBVTT

00:00:00.706 --> 00:00:02.369
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Would you like to go out for dinner?

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.396
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> I’d love to.

00:00:07.241 --> 00:00:08.961
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Are you free on Thursday?

00:00:10.899 --> 00:00:13.355
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> Sorry, I’m going to the cinema.

00:00:15.195 --> 00:00:16.589
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> What about Friday?

00:00:16.803 --> 00:00:17.895
What are you doing then?

00:00:19.799 --> 00:00:22.110
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> Nothing. Friday’s fine.

00:00:23.997 --> 00:00:24.540
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> OK.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:27.123
Let’s go to the new Italian place.

00:00:29.026 --> 00:00:29.801
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> Great!